ocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:1704:- `:yin.module/footprint` is what `yin.vm.dependency-completion.md`\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:1705:  needs to report `:complete`; an undeclared footprint is `:incomplete`,\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:1880:`:effectful` with a declared, non-empty `:yin.k/effects` set, and\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:2013:`:undeclared-free`; two outstanding requires on one response stream\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:2086:          src/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn_register_effects.cljc\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:2592:| Source order is not dominance;    | Agreed. Discharge requires an     |\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:5:> and a traversal. Supplies the `:yin.k/requires`, `:yin.k/store`, and\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:12:  specifies: `:yin.k/requires` (every field), the reachable store slice (§7.6.2),\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:17:  `footprint-table`), U7 (`yin.vm/occurrences`, `free-names`), U12 (UCF text),\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:60:     :requires    {:yin.k/segments #{address}\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:63:                   :yin.k/effects #{effect-id}\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:70:                   :footprints #{module-name}    ; module without declared footprint → :incomplete\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:140:remains the unit in `:items` and in the convergence test, as §7.7.3 requires.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:146:    {:store-keys  #{key}        ; :store-get / :store-put operands\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:149:     :effects     #{effect-id}  ; after footprint-table normalization, §7.7.1\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:223:    registry has a profile for sym       → :primitive ; :requires :yin.k/primitives gains {sym profile};\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:224:                                                      ; :yin.k/effects gains (:yin.k/effects profile)\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:227:                                                      ; :yin.k/effects gains the footprint's effects;\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:228:                                                      ; an undeclared footprint → :missing :footprints\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:238:                           :yin.k/arities [n…] :yin.k/effects #{…} :yin.k/host-state :none}\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:246:A `:call`'s effects are never inferred from syntax (footprint row `#{}`); they\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:247:enter only through the profile / footprint union above. This is the §7.7.2 rule.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:255:1. it is a `:store-keys` operand of loaded code and `(:store vm)` holds it;\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:260:A key that is a `:store-keys` operand but absent from the store goes to\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:302:         fold code-facts:  :store-keys → pull (§7.1); :parked-ids → pull (§7.2);\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:303:                           :ffi-ops, :effects → :requires; :free-names → discharge (§6)\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:311:         :incomplete  else if any of :parked :footprints :profiles :obligations non-empty\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:326:    {:yin.k/requires  (:requires state) with\ndocs/design/yin.vm.dependency-completion.md:345:- Reuses `yin.vm/ast-requirements`, `segment-requirements`, `footprint-table`,\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
